WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.800
Welcome to SPIL MAX. In this level we cover workplace safety across port and depot operations.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Every heavy equipment, container, and vessel movement demands full situational awareness.

3
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:16.800
Ensure complete PPE is worn before entering gantry lanes, container yards, or berths.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.200
Use clear two-way communication and report hazards immediately before incidents occur.

5
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:29.500
Safety is SPIL’s highest priority so every team member returns home safely.
